==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Emerging Powers|Swoobat|37}} from the {{TCG|Emerging Powers}} expansion.
*'''Psyshot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Kadabra|58}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

